@startuml
' State machine of booking.status (Report 4, Figure 23). States show the label of the figure and the value stored in the code.
skinparam dpi 180
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor #FFFFFF
  BorderColor #333333
}
skinparam ArrowColor #333333
hide empty description
state "Awaiting payment\n(rooms held 15 min)\n(PENDING)" as PENDING
state "Hold expired\n(EXPIRED)" as EXPIRED
state "Booking confirmed\n(CONFIRMED)" as CONFIRMED
state "Guest checked in\n(CHECKED_IN)" as CHECKED_IN
state "Guest checked out\n(COMPLETED)" as COMPLETED
state "No-show\n(NO_SHOW)" as NO_SHOW
state "Booking cancelled\n(CANCELLED)" as CANCELLED
[*] --> PENDING : Booking placed
PENDING --> EXPIRED : [Not paid within 15 min]
PENDING --> CONFIRMED : [Payment received] /\ninvoice paid, notification\nand email sent
CONFIRMED --> CONFIRMED : [Guest cancels, refund due] /\ninvoice REFUND_PENDING;\n[Owner rejects refund] / invoice PAID
CONFIRMED --> CANCELLED : [Guest cancels, no refund due]\nor [Owner approves the refund,\nor auto-approved at check-in time]
CONFIRMED --> CHECKED_IN : [Guest arrives] /\nstaff check the guest in
CHECKED_IN --> COMPLETED : [Guest leaves] /\nstaff check the guest out
CONFIRMED --> NO_SHOW : [Guest does not arrive] /\nstaff, or the system at the check-out time
EXPIRED --> [*]
CANCELLED --> [*]
COMPLETED --> [*]
NO_SHOW --> [*]
legend bottom
While the refund waits (invoice REFUND_PENDING, Figure 24) the booking stays CONFIRMED and check-in is refused.
There is no automatic check-out.
endlegend
@enduml
